     "article_id": "ART-2026-10-22-003",
     "event_id": "EVT-2026-10-22-002",
     "headline": "米国の金利：10年物の国債の利回りは10月20日に5.12%、政策の金利の実効値は3.88%で横ばい（FRB理事会の統計から）",
     "lines": [
      {
       "line_id": "L-003-01",
       "text": "FRB理事会が10月21日に公表した金利の統計（H.15）によると、米国の銀行どうしが短い期間にお金を貸し借りする金利（フェデラル・ファンド金利の実効値）は、10月14日から20日まで3.88%で変わらなかった。",
       "claimed_mark": "source_number_match",
       "numbers": [
        {
         "value": 3.88,
         "unit": "%",
         "label": "フェデラル・ファンド金利（実効）"
        }
       ],
       "source_ref": "SRC-006",
       "excerpt": "Federal funds (effective) 1 2 3   3.88   3.88   3.88   3.88   3.88",
       "attribution": "出典：Board of Governors of the Federal Reserve System「H.15 Selected Interest Rates (Daily) - October 21, 2026」（https://www.federalreserve.gov/releases/h15/）",
       "processing_note": "Board of Governors of the Federal Reserve System「H.15 Selected Interest Rates (Daily) - October 21, 2026」（https://www.federalreserve.gov/releases/h15/）をもとに本サイト作成",
       "mark": "source_number_match",
       "mark_reason": null
      },
      {
       "line_id": "L-003-02",
       "text": "同じ統計で、銀行が貸し出しの目安にする金利（プライムレート）は7.00%だった。",
       "claimed_mark": "source_number_match",
       "numbers": [
        {
         "value": 7.0,
         "unit": "%",
         "label": "プライムレート"
        }
       ],
       "source_ref": "SRC-006",
       "excerpt": "Bank prime loan 2 3 7   7.00   7.00   7.00   7.00   7.00",
       "attribution": "出典：Board of Governors of the Federal Reserve System「H.15 Selected Interest Rates (Daily) - October 21, 2026」（https://www.federalreserve.gov/releases/h15/）",
       "processing_note": "Board of Governors of the Federal Reserve System「H.15 Selected Interest Rates (Daily) - October 21, 2026」（https://www.federalreserve.gov/releases/h15/）をもとに本サイト作成",
       "mark": "source_number_match",
       "mark_reason": null
      },
      {
       "line_id": "L-003-03",
       "text": "中央銀行が銀行に直接お金を貸す窓口の金利（プライマリー・クレジット）は4.00%だった。",
       "claimed_mark": "source_number_match",
       "numbers": [
        {
         "value": 4.0,
         "unit": "%",
         "label": "プライマリー・クレジットの金利"
        }
       ],
       "source_ref": "SRC-006",
       "excerpt": "Discount window primary credit 2 8   4.00   4.00   4.00   4.00   4.00",
       "attribution": "出典：Board of Governors of the Federal Reserve System「H.15 Selected Interest Rates (Daily) - October 21, 2026」（https://www.federalreserve.gov/releases/h15/）",
       "processing_note": "Board of Governors of the Federal Reserve System「H.15 Selected Interest Rates (Daily) - October 21, 2026」（https://www.federalreserve.gov/releases/h15/）をもとに本サイト作成",
       "mark": "source_number_match",
       "mark_reason": null
      },
      {
       "line_id": "L-003-04",
       "text": "米国債の10年物の利回り（満期をそろえた換算値）は、10月14日の5.19%から20日は5.12%になった。",
       "claimed_mark": "source_number_match",
       "numbers": [
        {
         "value": 5.19,
         "unit": "%",
         "label": "10年物国債利回り（10月14日）"
        },
        {
         "value": 5.12,
         "unit": "%",
         "label": "10年物国債利回り（10月20日）"
        }
       ],
       "source_ref": "SRC-006",
       "excerpt": "10-year  5.19   5.10   5.09   5.15   5.12",
       "attribution": "出典：Board of Governors of the Federal Reserve System「H.15 Selected Interest Rates (Daily) - October 21, 2026」（https://www.federalreserve.gov/releases/h15/）",
       "processing_note": "Board of Governors of the Federal Reserve System「H.15 Selected Interest Rates (Daily) - October 21, 2026」（https://www.federalreserve.gov/releases/h15/）をもとに本サイト作成",
       "mark": "source_number_match",
       "mark_reason": null
      },
      {
       "line_id": "L-003-05",
       "text": "2年物の利回りは、10月14日の4.82%から20日は4.79%だった。",
       "claimed_mark": "source_number_match",
       "numbers": [
        {
         "value": 4.82,
         "unit": "%",
         "label": "2年物国債利回り（10月14日）"
        },
        {
         "value": 4.79,
         "unit": "%",
         "label": "2年物国債利回り（10月20日）"
        }
       ],
       "source_ref": "SRC-006",
       "excerpt": "2-year  4.82   4.77   4.74   4.77   4.79",
       "attribution": "出典：Board of Governors of the Federal Reserve System「H.15 Selected Interest Rates (Daily) - October 21, 2026」（https://www.federalreserve.gov/releases/h15/）",
       "processing_note": "Board of Governors of the Federal Reserve System「H.15 Selected Interest Rates (Daily) - October 21, 2026」（https://www.federalreserve.gov/releases/h15/）をもとに本サイト作成",
       "mark": "source_number_match",
       "mark_reason": null
      },
      {
       "line_id": "L-003-06",
       "text": "30年物の利回りは、10月14日の5.52%から20日は5.42%だった。",
       "claimed_mark": "source_number_match",
       "numbers": [
        {
         "value": 5.52,
         "unit": "%",
         "label": "30年物国債利回り（10月14日）"
        },
        {
         "value": 5.42,
         "unit": "%",
         "label": "30年物国債利回り（10月20日）"
        }
       ],
       "source_ref": "SRC-006",
       "excerpt": "30-year  5.52   5.43   5.43   5.48   5.42",
       "attribution": "出典：Board of Governors of the Federal Reserve System「H.15 Selected Interest Rates (Daily) - October 21, 2026」（https://www.federalreserve.gov/releases/h15/）",
       "processing_note": "Board of Governors of the Federal Reserve System「H.15 Selected Interest Rates (Daily) - October 21, 2026」（https://www.federalreserve.gov/releases/h15/）をもとに本サイト作成",
       "mark": "source_number_match",
       "mark_reason": null
      },
      {
       "line_id": "L-003-07",
       "text": "期間の長い国債の利回りは、先の金利や物価についての見方を映して動く。期間の短い金利は、中央銀行の政策の金利に近い動きをしやすい。",
       "claimed_mark": "explainer",
       "numbers": [],
       "source_ref": null,
       "excerpt": null,
       "attribution": null,
       "processing_note": null,
       "mark": "explainer",
       "mark_reason": null
      },
      {
       "line_id": "L-003-08",
       "text": "米国の金利が高いと、ドルで預けたり貸したりするほうが有利になり、円とドルの交換の値段（為替）にも影響が出ることがある。",
       "claimed_mark": "explainer",
       "numbers": [],
       "source_ref": null,
       "excerpt": null,
       "attribution": null,
       "processing_note": null,
       "mark": "explainer",
       "mark_reason": null
      }
     ],
     "inferences": [
      {
       "inference_id": "INF-2026-10-22-003-1",
       "text": "米国の長い期間の金利が5%を超える水準で続けば、ドルでお金を借りて海外で貸し出す日本の銀行業では、ドルの調達の費用が高い状態が続く可能性がある。",
       "falsifier": "11月末までに米国債10年物の利回りが4.5%を下回れば、この見方は成り立たない。",
       "check_metric": "FRB理事会 H.15 の米国債10年物（Treasury constant maturities, 10-year）の利回り",
       "check_by": "2026-11-30"
      }
     ],
     "followup": {
      "is_followup": false,
      "first_seen": null,
      "first_seen_edition_id": null,
      "has_new_source": null
     }
    }
   ]
